# Point on object on an empty sketch: a slanted segment L1 and two points.
# Tool first, P3, then M for the method "on the segment", then L1:
# on_segment(P3, L1). On the selection of P4 and L1: on_line(P4, L1).
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 360 339
click L 798 306
action tool.point
wait 2
click L 579 175
click L 469 503
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.point_on_object
wait 2
click L 579 175
key M
wait 2
click L 689 314
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element P4 element L1
action tool.point_on_object
wait 4
